# Keep every byte exactly as it was written. The checks hash each tool's source (tool.tsx + its pinned runtime), and the
# pipeline's own files use LF or CRLF on purpose, so a clone with core.autocrlf (the Git for Windows default) must NEVER
# rewrite line endings: that would make every finished tool read "source changed since its last check".
* -text
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ogg binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
